-- 95% less damage
-- 100% smaller splash
-- Secondary fire only
- F-187 Fusioncutter (Stun Baton)
-- Burns on hit
-- Lightweight
-- 80% faster RoF
-- 65% less damage
- Makeshift Servo Launcher (Clone Pistol 2)
-- Secondary fire only
-- 20% more damage

^6Inventory:
- Defense Seeker

^5Force Powers:
- Sense (3)

^8Attributes:
- 10% less knockback given
- 40% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2/3]"